@startuml
' UC15.1 - Thêm Module
autonumber "<b>0.</b> "
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam MaxMessageSize 200

' AS-IS evidence; paths are relative to the workspace root.
' UC source: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_UseCase.docx, UC15.1 table row.
' BR source: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_QuyTacNghiepVu.docx, BR-79/80/88/284/285.
' Both requested DOCX files were found under docs/uml/docs, not directly under docs.
' Their core revision is 1; metadata does not identify a business-spec release.
' docs/source-of-truth is absent; architecture prose is not runtime evidence.
' UI: frontend/src/pages/instructor/course.builder.module.add.tsx:25 (handleSave).
' Route: frontend/src/router.tsx:457 and :467 (modules/new).
' Wrapper: frontend/src/services/course.service.ts:60 (createCourseModuleAPI).
' Transport: frontend/src/services/axios.customize.ts:47/:61/:64; course.service.ts:1.
' URL: frontend/src/config/env.ts:13; frontend/.env.development:10.
' Local development Course base URL is http://localhost:8080; no local override file found.
' Corresponding process VITE_* variables are unset; other launch modes remain unverified.
' Gateway: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml:40-43.
' Trusted context: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/java/com/learnup/gateway/filter/JwtAuthenticationFilter.java:133.
' Prefix/version: services/course-service/src/main.ts:40-43 (api, URI v1).
' Controller: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.controller.ts:79 (createModule).
' Service: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.service.ts:264 (createModule).
' Repository: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.repository.ts:148/:167.
' Models: services/course-service/prisma/schema.prisma:18/:31/:67.
' DB adapter: services/course-service/src/infrastructure/prisma/prisma.service.ts:10.
' services/course-service/.env:2 selects course_db; credentials are intentionally omitted.
' Post-save refresh: module.add.tsx:52-57; layout.instructor.course.tsx:35-58.
' Refresh wrapper/controller/service/repository: course.service.ts:55;
' courses.controller.ts:73; courses.service.ts:195; courses.repository.ts:108.

actor Instructor
boundary "Add Module Page" as Screen
participant ":ApiGateway" as Gateway
participant ":CoursesController" as Controller
participant ":CoursesService" as Service
participant ":CoursesRepository" as Repository
database "course_db" as CourseDB

' Preconditions: authenticated Instructor, existing Course Builder context loaded.
' Entry route: /instructor/courses/{courseId}/builder/modules/new.
' Initial Course/tree reads belong to UC15 preparation and are not expanded here.
' JWT/internal-key middleware and token refresh are not the main UC interaction.

activate Instructor
Instructor -> Screen: Open Add Module
activate Screen
Instructor -> Screen: Enter title and select Add Module
Screen -> Screen: Check title and structure editability
activate Screen
deactivate Screen

' UI trims the title, prevents duplicate saves, and disables editing when structureLocked.
' structureLocked is lockedAt != null OR status == Submitted, from loaded builder context.
alt Form checked successfully
  Screen -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/modules\nModule title
  activate Gateway
  Gateway -> Controller: POST /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/modules\nTrusted user context
  activate Controller
  Controller -> Service: Create Module
  activate Service
  Service -> Service: Verify Instructor and organization
  activate Service
  deactivate Service

  ' Outcome-level alternative: expand successful processing only in the success operand.
  ' Failed attempts stop at the rejecting check; omitted lookups are not successful writes.
  alt Module created successfully
    Service -> Repository: Find Course by tenant and owner
    activate Repository
    ' Course.id and Course.organizationId must match; Course.chain.instructorId == user.userId.
    Repository -> CourseDB: Read owned Course and edit status
    activate CourseDB
    CourseDB -->> Repository: Course, status and lockedAt
    deactivate CourseDB
    Repository -->> Service: Owned Course
    deactivate Repository
    Service -> Service: Check Course is not Submitted or Locked
    activate Service
    deactivate Service

    Service -> Repository: Create Module at end of Course
    activate Repository
    ' One Prisma $transaction reads the last position descending, then inserts a Module.
    ' Both operations use the current Course and organization; position = (last?.position ?? 0) + 1.
    ' No Lesson is created; no existing Module position is changed.
    Repository -> CourseDB: Append Module at next position\nSingle transaction
    activate CourseDB
    CourseDB -->> Repository: Saved Module
    deactivate CourseDB
    Repository -->> Service: Saved Module
    deactivate Repository
    Service -->> Controller: Created Module
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 201 Created\nModule details
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Created Module
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show "Module created."

    ' handleSave always awaits refetchStructure after creation; retain this supporting REST.
    ' This is a result refresh, not a second UC15 interaction or a Lesson/Assessment operation.
    ' Only its successful trace is expanded; independent refresh errors are described below.
    Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/structure
    activate Gateway
    Gateway -> Controller: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/structure\nTrusted user context
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Service: Refresh Course structure
    activate Service
    ' getStructure repeats Instructor/organization checks and scopes ownership in findStructure.
    Service -> Repository: Load owned Course structure
    activate Repository
    Repository -> CourseDB: Read Course structure\nCurrent tenant and owner
    activate CourseDB
    CourseDB -->> Repository: Course structure
    deactivate CourseDB
    Repository -->> Service: Course structure
    deactivate Repository
    Service -->> Controller: Updated structure and lock state
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 200 OK\nUpdated structure
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Updated structure
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -> Screen: Return to Course Builder
    activate Screen
    deactivate Screen
  else Module creation failed\nBusiness checks rejected
    ' Restore incoming executions closed by the successful operand.
    activate Gateway
    activate Controller
    activate Service
    ' Non-INSTRUCTOR or missing organizationId -> 403, before the ownership query.
    ' Empty normalized title -> 400; ordinary DTO validation is not expanded.
    ' findOwnedCourseForEditing -> null for missing Course, wrong tenant or wrong owner -> 404.
    ' After a matching read: Submitted -> 400, then lockedAt present -> 400.
    ' These business rejections do not call createModule and do not write a Module.
    Service -->> Controller: Module rejected\n400 / 403 / 404
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 400 / 403 / 404
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Creation error
    deactivate Gateway
    ' HttpExceptionFilter returns error, not top-level message; UI therefore uses its fallback.
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show "Unable to create Module."
  end
else Form check failed
  ' Invalid title or cached structureLocked prevents POST; saving=true also ignores re-entry.
  ' Controls are disabled for locked/submitted Courses; handleSave also rejects stale UI attempts.
  Screen -->> Instructor: Keep form disabled or show validation error
end
deactivate Screen
deactivate Instructor

' BR-79: owner scoping uses chain.instructorId; tenant isolation additionally uses organizationId.
' BR-80/88: persisted lockedAt blocks adding a Module; no enrollment lookup is made by this UC.
' First-Enrollment lock propagation is outside this trace and has not been validated here.
' BR-284: Published and unlocked is permitted; there is no Draft-only create guard.
' BR-285: Submitted is rejected before the independent lockedAt check.
' Guard limitation: ownership/status/lockedAt read happens before the Module transaction;
' no in-transaction ownership/status recheck or explicit row lock exists in these methods.
' Concurrent appends share @@unique([courseId, position]); no retry is implemented here.
' Technical transport/persistence failures are omitted as distinct branches; UI uses a create error.
' A failed transaction rolls back its Module write; a failed UI refresh does not undo creation.
' loadStructure catches refresh errors, clears structure and records an error, then resolves.
' handleSave still navigates to the builder; the parent layout may show a load error instead of a tree.
' No claim is made that every successful POST guarantees a successfully refreshed outline.
' Parent-layout Assignment reads on route changes are unrelated to Module creation and omitted.
' TenantClient/LearningClient are injected into CoursesService, but neither createModule nor
' getStructure calls them. No cross-service REST, storage, Kafka, presigned URL or client lifeline.
' No Lesson creation, title editing, reorder, deletion, approval submission or full UC15 expansion.
@enduml
